===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|frm|ouyr}}, {{m|frm|ouïr}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|oir}}, from {{inh|fr|la|audīre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|audiō}}, from {{der|fr|ine-pro|*h₂ew-is-d-}}, a compound of {{der|roa-opt|ine-pro|*h₂ewis||clearly, manifestly}} (from the root {{m|ine-pro|*h₂ew-||to see, perceive}}) and {{m|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-|*dʰh₁-ye/o-|to render}}.

